{"id":624,"slug":"624-cach-su-dung-zustand-voi-typescript-de-co-type-safety","category":"State Management","subcategory":"Zustand","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Cách sử dụng Zustand với TypeScript để có type safety?","question_en":"How do you use Zustand with TypeScript for type safety?","answer_vi":"Zustand v4+ dùng curried `create`: `create<StoreType>()((set, get) => ({ ... }))` — thiếu cặp `()` thứ hai thì TypeScript không infer đúng. Định nghĩa type cho toàn bộ store trước, rồi truyền vào generic.\n\n```ts\ninterface CartStore {\n  items: CartItem[]\n  total: number\n  addItem: (item: CartItem) => void\n  clearCart: () => void\n}\n\nconst useCartStore = create<CartStore>()((set, get) => ({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0,\n  addItem: (item) => set((s) => ({\n    items: [...s.items, item],\n    total: s.total + item.price,\n  })),\n  clearCart: () => set({ items: [], total: 0 }),\n}))\n```\n\nVới slice thì dùng type `StateCreator`:\n\n```ts\ntype CartSlice = { items: CartItem[]; addItem: (item: CartItem) => void }\n\nconst createCartSlice: StateCreator<BoundStore, [], [], CartSlice> = (set) => ({\n  items: [],\n  addItem: (item) => set((s) => ({ items: [...s.items, item] })),\n})\n```\n\nSuy ngược type của store từ chính store: `type StoreState = ReturnType<typeof useStore.getState>`.\n\n**Lưu ý:** đừng dùng `create` mà bỏ generic — mất type safety và `set` nhận `any`","answer_en":"Zustand v4+ uses a curried `create`: `create<StoreType>()((set, get) => ({ ... }))` — without the second `()` TypeScript cannot infer correctly. Define the type for the whole store first, then pass it as the generic.\n\n```ts\ninterface CartStore {\n  items: CartItem[]\n  total: number\n  addItem: (item: CartItem) => void\n  clearCart: () => void\n}\n\nconst useCartStore = create<CartStore>()((set, get) => ({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0,\n  addItem: (item) => set((s) => ({\n    items: [...s.items, item],\n    total: s.total + item.price,\n  })),\n  clearCart: () => set({ items: [], total: 0 }),\n}))\n```\n\nFor slices, use the `StateCreator` type:\n\n```ts\ntype CartSlice = { items: CartItem[]; addItem: (item: CartItem) => void }\n\nconst createCartSlice: StateCreator<BoundStore, [], [], CartSlice> = (set) => ({\n  items: [],\n  addItem: (item) => set((s) => ({ items: [...s.items, item] })),\n})\n```\n\nInfer the store type from the store itself: `type StoreState = ReturnType<typeof useStore.getState>`.\n\n**Note:** never call `create` without the generic — you lose type safety and `set` accepts `any`","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Zustand v4+ dùng curried <code>create</code>: <code>create&lt;StoreType&gt;()((set, get) =&gt; ({ ... }))</code> — thiếu cặp <code>()</code> thứ hai thì TypeScript không infer đúng.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Định nghĩa type cho toàn bộ store trước, rồi truyền vào generic.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"interface CartStore {\n  items: CartItem[]\n  total: number\n  addItem: (item: CartItem) =&gt; void\n  clearCart: () =&gt; void\n}\n\nconst useCartStore = create&lt;CartStore&gt;()((set, get) =&gt; ({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0,\n  addItem: (item) =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({\n    items: [...s.items, item],\n    total: s.total + item.price,\n  })),\n  clearCart: () =&gt; set({ items: [], total: 0 }),\n}))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartStore</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span>[]\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">item</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clearCart</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> useCartStore = create&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartStore</span>&gt;()(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">set, get</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [...s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">items</span>, item],\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">total</span> + item.<span class=\"hljs-property\">price</span>,\n  })),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clearCart</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> }),\n}))</code></pre></div><p>Với slice thì dùng type <code>StateCreator</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type CartSlice = { items: CartItem[]; addItem: (item: CartItem) =&gt; void }\n\nconst createCartSlice: StateCreator&lt;BoundStore, [], [], CartSlice&gt; = (set) =&gt; ({\n  items: [],\n  addItem: (item) =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({ items: [...s.items, item] })),\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartSlice</span> = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span>[]; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">item</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">createCartSlice</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StateCreator</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BoundStore</span>, [], [], <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartSlice</span>&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">set</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt;</span> ({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [...s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">items</span>, item] })),\n})</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Suy ngược type của store từ chính store:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type StoreState = ReturnType&lt;typeof useStore.getState&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StoreState</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReturnType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> useStore.<span class=\"hljs-property\">getState</span>&gt;</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> đừng dùng <code>create</code> mà bỏ generic — mất type safety và <code>set</code> nhận <code>any</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Zustand v4+ uses a curried <code>create</code>: <code>create&lt;StoreType&gt;()((set, get) =&gt; ({ ... }))</code> — without the second <code>()</code> TypeScript cannot infer correctly.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Define the type for the whole store first, then pass it as the generic.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"interface CartStore {\n  items: CartItem[]\n  total: number\n  addItem: (item: CartItem) =&gt; void\n  clearCart: () =&gt; void\n}\n\nconst useCartStore = create&lt;CartStore&gt;()((set, get) =&gt; ({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0,\n  addItem: (item) =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({\n    items: [...s.items, item],\n    total: s.total + item.price,\n  })),\n  clearCart: () =&gt; set({ items: [], total: 0 }),\n}))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartStore</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span>[]\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">item</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clearCart</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> useCartStore = create&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartStore</span>&gt;()(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">set, get</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [...s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">items</span>, item],\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">total</span> + item.<span class=\"hljs-property\">price</span>,\n  })),\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clearCart</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">total</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> }),\n}))</code></pre></div><p>For slices, use the <code>StateCreator</code> type:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">ts</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type CartSlice = { items: CartItem[]; addItem: (item: CartItem) =&gt; void }\n\nconst createCartSlice: StateCreator&lt;BoundStore, [], [], CartSlice&gt; = (set) =&gt; ({\n  items: [],\n  addItem: (item) =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({ items: [...s.items, item] })),\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartSlice</span> = { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span>[]; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">item</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartItem</span></span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">void</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">createCartSlice</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StateCreator</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">BoundStore</span>, [], [], <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CartSlice</span>&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">set</span>) =&gt;</span> ({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addItem</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item</span>) =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">s</span>) =&gt;</span> ({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">items</span>: [...s.<span class=\"hljs-property\">items</span>, item] })),\n})</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Infer the store type from the store itself:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type StoreState = ReturnType&lt;typeof useStore.getState&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StoreState</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReturnType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> useStore.<span class=\"hljs-property\">getState</span>&gt;</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> never call <code>create</code> without the generic — you lose type safety and <code>set</code> accepts <code>any</code>.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/616-zustand-la-gi-so-sanh-voi-redux-ve-do-phuc-tap","title":"Zustand là gì? So sánh với Redux về độ phức tạp?"},{"url":"/q/617-cach-tao-mot-store-voi-zustand-nhu-the-nao","title":"Cách tạo một store với Zustand như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/618-cach-dinh-nghia-actions-trong-zustand-store","title":"Cách định nghĩa actions trong Zustand store?"},{"url":"/q/619-zustand-khac-redux-nhu-the-nao-ve-kien-truc","title":"Zustand khác Redux như thế nào về kiến trúc?"},{"url":